216:Wanjiro
217:Cleaning is really not my thing... A yard is not complete without weeds and leaves to begin with. How annoying...
218:player
219:Wanjiro, did Miki Nikaidou ever come to Mahjong Soul Shrine today?
220:Oho, it's you, {var:player_nickname}. Nice timing.
