222:I promised others to play Mahjong later, so I will leave the cleaning of the yard to you. Remember to do it properly. Otherwise, when Ichihime comes back, she will be mad.
223:But I came here for Miki Nikaidou.
224:Oh, that woman comes every day. It's about time... She will probably arrive when you finish cleaning, don't worry.
225:Wanjiro swiftly trotted away, leaving me behind to face the large yard. I had no choice but to help him clean it.
226:I waited until the sunset, but Miki Nikaidou never appeared. Where did she go?
227:According to Ichihime, Miki Nikaidou often went out with that guy recently.//nGoing out... Was that like, dating? Should I try my luck at busy places like shopping malls?
228:Thinking about it, I walked to the shopping mall. It was a holiday so everywhere was very busy. A sales event was going on and there seemed to be an advertising banner with Kana Fujita as the brand ambassador in front... Wait, no. It wasn't a banner. It was Kana Fujita herself!
229:I walked up and patted her on the shoulder.
230:Kana Fujita
232:She seemed to realize it was a public shopping mall and immediately covered her mouth while pulling me aside.
233:How did you recognize Kana? I was in disguise!
234:It's only a hat and sunglasses. Anyone who knows you enough can tell it's you... Do you really think this disguise will work? It's not like we are in a manga or novel.
235:Hmph! In the end, Kana's presence is just too strong. No matter how I disguise myself, my brilliance as an idol is unable to be shadowed.
236:Ok, Miss Idol. May I ask what you were looking at?
237:As I spoke, Kana Fujita suddenly pulled me to where she was standing and pointed to the front.
238:See, isn't that the flirty owner of Tenhoukaku? I never thought she could be dating a man. Are they a couple?
239:I looked in the direction she pointed. Not surprisingly, I saw Miki Nikaidou and a strange man with excellent manners not far away. However...
240:I never knew you idols could be so gossipy. I always thought it was the other way around - you were always the subject of the gossips.
242:Ha, being an idol sure has a lot of restrictions.
243:I'm really curious about what they are talking. Let's go eavesdrop, shall we?
244:I don't think that's the right thing to do...
245:You are quite close with her, aren't you? What if this man is a bad one? We are helping your friend here.
246:But how are we going to eavesdrop on them?
247:Let's have some coffee on the table next to theirs. Even if they find out, we can say something like "what a coincidence!". The coffee is on you though.
248:All those idol dramas she performed were not wasted. Only she could think of something so dramatic.
249:I am quite curious too. Agree with Kana Fujita's suggestion
250:Eavesdropping isn't good...
251:I wonder if Miki Nikaidou will meet him at his university. May as well try my luck.
252:Thinking about it, I walked to National University of Fuuchi, but it was a holiday so the university was quite empty.
255:Just when I was thinking if I should leave, someone said good afternoon to me. It was Hinata Takanashi.
256:Good afternoon.
257:Hinata Takanashi
258:Today is a holiday. {var:player_nickname}, why are you still in the uni?
259:I was just...walking around and happened to be here. Haha. Why did you come to the uni, Takanashi?
260:I came to take care of the plants in the gardening club. Even during holidays, they must be properly watered and nurtured.
261:You really like the plants, don't you?
262:Because I can feel the serenity and comfort of nature when I stay around them. {var:player_nickname}, would you like to feel it too?
263:Hmm?
264:Um, you said you were just walking around, right? So I was thinking... would you like to visit our gardening club as well? It will be fun.
265:I have a feeling that if I say no, Hinata Takanashi will be quite upset. I should probably go with her, and also enjoy the peaceful nature.
266:In the end, I didn't have time to look for Miki Nikaidou until sunset. I wonder how she spent the day...
267:I see. The coffee is on me then.
268:{var:player_nickname}, you are really nice, haha.
269:We sat on a table behind Miki Nikaidou and the man. They didn't see us because we were blocked by the restaurant's ornamental plants.
270:After listening to their conversation for a while...
271:What are they talking about? I seem to understand every word, but have no idea what they mean when all the words are put together.
272:I think I heard a few names of places.
274:But we have no evidence to prove that they are in a relationship.
275:But they are having coffee together.
276:Aren't we also having coffee here... Haha.
