279:You realized it, didn't you? My disguise was unable to shadow my idol charisma. That's why I must bring you along. My fans will never believe that Kana will go shopping with someone as ordinary as you, so even they see me, they will just think it's someone with a similar look.
280:With her irrefutably absurd reasoning, Kana Fujita pulled me away and continued shopping. I wanted to ask Miki Nikaidou in person but didn't have a chance.
281:Maybe next time.
282:Miki Nikaidou is a grown up woman and she has her freedom to make her own friends. As friends, we shouldn't care too much.
283:Well, since you say so, let's call it. {var:player_nickname}, you are such a nice person.
